desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Moment Deprecated"
	title_zh: "Moment Deprecated"
	type: audit
	level: low
	rule_id: "source-best-practice-moment-deprecated"
	risk: "best-practice"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Moment is a legacy project in maintenance mode. Consider using libraries that are actively supported, e.g. `dayjs`.

### 风险类型
最佳实践（best-practice）

### 影响
代码或配置不符合推荐实践，长期来看可能引入安全或维护风险。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
按官方推荐方式改写，并补充必要的安全配置。

推荐修复：
Consider using libraries that are actively supported, e.g. `dayjs`.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.ts": <<<POS
import 'moment'
POS
	"safefile://pos.ts": <<<NEG
import 'date-fns'
NEG
)

${*.ts}.pattern_regex(/(?:import\s+'moment')/) as $p0
${*.js}.pattern_regex(/(?:import\s+'moment')/) as $p1
$p0 + $p1 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "low",
	title: "Moment Deprecated",
	title_zh: "Moment Deprecated",
	message: "Moment Deprecated detected.",
}
